{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207380","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207380","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1720738001:1":{"text":"奥様、どうか気を落とさないで。これを……あなたのために用意してきたの。","source_cn":"夫人，请节哀。这是……这是我为您准备的花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBAD6D707C87AE7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"白バラの花束","source_cn":"白玫瑰花束","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E4E0B7E8995E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720738002:0":{"text":"この花束を……私に？","source_cn":"这是……给我的？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A92B649CDA9EBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720738003:1":{"text":"ええ、少しでも慰めになればと思って。","source_cn":"是的。希望能带给您一丝慰藉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBB9D74072993F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720738004:1":{"text":"ありがとうね、お嬢さん。でも……この花束はちと華やかすぎるかねぇ……","source_cn":"谢谢你的好意，小姑娘。但这花……太华丽了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785DBD5E73EAA171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720738005:0":{"text":"こんなのは、ビロードの敷かれた化粧台とか、クリスタルの花瓶にこそ似合うんじゃないかしら。","source_cn":"它适合摆在铺着天鹅绒桌布的梳妆台上，或者插在王宫的水晶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FBB8CB7AA3CAC56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720738006:0":{"text":"墓前なんかに置いたら、この質素な墓石がもっと寂しく見えてしまうだろうね。","source_cn":"放在坟墓前的话，只会让这冰冷的墓碑看起来更加凄凉吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33643D13A421B6A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720738007:1":{"text":"で、でも……","source_cn":"可、可是……<key:dialog37>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x402656A775F521A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720738008:1":{"text":"私の息子のジュリノはね、二十年前のあの神魔大戦で命を落としたのさ。","source_cn":"我的儿子朱利诺，是在二十年前的那场神魔大战中牺牲的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9805973512A5E869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720738009:1":{"text":"まだあんな若かったのに……サバンナを守るんだって、迷うことなく家を出ていったよ……","source_cn":"那时候，他还那么年轻，为了保护身后的赛凡纳，他义无反顾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93C00E08418D01F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720738010:1":{"text":"それが今となっては、誰もあの子のことなんか覚えちゃいない。あんな賑やかな祭りをして、皆でサバンナの繁栄を称えてるけど、その繁栄を何と引き替えに得たのかは考えもしないんだ。","source_cn":"可是现在，还有谁记得他？还有谁记得那些像他一样死去的孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B963CCB34345446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720738011:1":{"text":"お嬢さん、私はこんなきれいな花はいらないの。ただ、一人でも多くの人に……かつてジュリノという青年が、サバンナのために血を流したことを知ってほしいだけ……","source_cn":"姑娘，我不需要这些漂亮的花。我只想让多一个人知道，曾经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8886449931F561F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720738012:1":{"text":"サバンナの……ため……","source_cn":"为了……赛凡纳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE0F63F1B3A48FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720738013:1":{"text":"ごめんなさい、奥様……そして教えてくれてありがとう。ジュリノという名前、しっかり心に刻んだわ。","source_cn":"对不起……夫人。还有，谢谢你告诉我这些。我会把朱利诺这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E731CDC57B3603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1720738013":{"text":"ごめんなさい、奥様……そして教えてくれてありがとう。ジュリノという名前、しっかり心に刻んだわ。","source_cn":"对不起……夫人。还有，谢谢你告诉我这些。我会把朱利诺这个名字记在心里的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E731CDC57B3603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720738014:2":{"text":"ペギー、行